{"seq":10,"slug":"lc0082-remove-duplicates-sorted-list-ii","title":"LeetCode 82 删除排序链表中的重复元素 II","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0082-remove-duplicates-sorted-list-ii","wordCount":935,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-82-删除排序链表中的重复元素-ii\">LeetCode 82 删除排序链表中的重复元素 II</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定一个已排序的链表的头 <code>head</code>，删除原始链表中所有重复数字的节点，只留下不同的数字。返回已排序的结果链表。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [1,2,3,3,4,4,5]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[1,2,5]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>输入：<code>head = [1,1,1,2,3]</code></li>\n<li>输出：<code>[2,3]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>链表中节点数目在范围 <code>[0, 300]</code> 内</li>\n<li><code>-100 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n<li>题目数据保证链表已经按升序排列</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注意本题与 LC #83 的区别：LC #83 是保留一个重复节点，本题是<strong>完全删除</strong>所有出现过重复的节点。例如 <code>[1,1,2]</code> 在 #83 中结果是 <code>[1,2]</code>，在本题中结果是 <code>[2]</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"前驱指针法\">前驱指针法</h3><p>由于需要完全删除重复节点（包括第一次出现），我们需要一个前驱指针 <code>prev</code> 来跳过整段重复区域。当发现当前值与下一个值相同时，用一个内循环跳过所有相同值的节点，然后让 <code>prev.next</code> 直接指向跳过后的第一个不同节点。</p>\n<p>关键步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>创建哑节点 <code>dummy</code>，<code>prev</code> 从 <code>dummy</code> 开始</li>\n<li>用 <code>current</code> 指针检查 <code>prev.next</code> 及后续节点</li>\n<li>如果 <code>current.val === current.next.val</code>，说明发现重复</li>\n<li>内循环跳过所有值相同的节点</li>\n<li><code>prev.next</code> 直接指向跳过后的节点（跳过整段重复区域）</li>\n<li>如果没有重复，<code>prev</code> 正常前进一步</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>为什么需要哑节点？</strong> 因为头节点本身可能是重复节点需要被删除。哑节点让我们总是有一个「安全的前驱」来执行删除操作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>头部重复</td>\n<td>[1,1,2,3]</td>\n<td>[2,3]</td>\n<td>头节点被删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>尾部重复</td>\n<td>[1,2,3,3]</td>\n<td>[1,2]</td>\n<td>尾部节点被删除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全部重复</td>\n<td>[1,1,2,2]</td>\n<td>[]</td>\n<td>返回空链表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无重复</td>\n<td>[1,2,3]</td>\n<td>[1,2,3]</td>\n<td>原样返回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续多组重复</td>\n<td>[1,1,2,2,3]</td>\n<td>[3]</td>\n<td>多段被删除</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"class ListNode {&#10;  val: number;&#10;  next: ListNode | null;&#10;  constructor(val?: number, next?: ListNode | null) {&#10;    this.val = val ?? 0;&#10;    this.next = next ?? null;&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function deleteDuplicates(head: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  const dummy = new ListNode(0, head);&#10;  let prev = dummy;&#10;&#10;  while (prev.next !== null) {&#10;    let current = prev.next;&#10;&#10;    if (current.next !== null &amp;&amp; current.val === current.next.val) {&#10;      const dupVal = current.val;&#10;      while (current !== null &amp;&amp; current.val === dupVal) {&#10;        current = current.next!;&#10;      }&#10;      prev.next = current;&#10;    } else {&#10;      prev = prev.next;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dummy.next;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">val</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deleteDuplicates</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dummy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, head);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dummy;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (prev.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next.val) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dupVal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.val;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dupVal) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      prev.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      prev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dummy.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑解析：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>外循环遍历链表，<code>prev</code> 始终指向已确认不重复部分的最后一个节点</li>\n<li>当发现 <code>current.val === current.next.val</code> 时，记录重复值 <code>dupVal</code></li>\n<li>内循环跳过所有值为 <code>dupVal</code> 的节点</li>\n<li><code>prev.next = current</code> 将前驱直接连接到第一个不同值的节点</li>\n<li>如果没有发现重复，<code>prev</code> 安全前进一步</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"执行过程示例\">执行过程示例</h3><p>以 <code>head = [1,2,3,3,4,4,5]</code> 为例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>prev 位置</th>\n<th>current</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>链表状态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>dummy</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1≠2，prev前进</td>\n<td>dummy→1→2→3→3→4→4→5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2≠3，prev前进</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>3=3，发现重复</td>\n<td>跳过两个3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3&#39;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>prev.next=4</td>\n<td>dummy→1→2→4→4→5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4=4，发现重复</td>\n<td>跳过两个4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4&#39;</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>prev.next=5</td>\n<td>dummy→1→2→5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>5无后继，prev前进</td>\n<td>dummy→1→2→5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最终结果：<code>[1,2,5]</code></p>\n<h3 id=\"与-lc-83-的对比\">与 LC #83 的对比</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function deleteDuplicatesKeepOne(head: ListNode | null): ListNode | null {&#10;  let current = head;&#10;  while (current !== null &amp;&amp; current.next !== null) {&#10;    if (current.val === current.next.val) {&#10;      current.next = current.next.next;&#10;    } else {&#10;      current = current.next;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  return head;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deleteDuplicatesKeepOne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">head</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ListNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (current.val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next.val) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      current.next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      current </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>LC #83 不需要哑节点（头节点永远保留），也不需要前驱指针（只需跳过后续重复节点）。本题更复杂，因为需要判断「是否发生过重复」来决定前驱指针的行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>每个节点最多被访问两次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>仅使用常数个指针变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 每个节点在外循环中被 <code>prev.next</code> 访问一次，在内循环中被跳过一次，总共最多 2n 次操作。虽然有嵌套循环，但内循环的总执行次数不超过 n，因此整体仍是 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> 仅使用 <code>dummy</code>、<code>prev</code>、<code>current</code> 三个指针和一个 <code>dupVal</code> 变量，空间为 O(1)。</p>\n<p>本题是链表删除操作的进阶版本，核心技巧是「前驱指针 + 哑节点」。当删除条件涉及到节点本身（而非仅删除后继）时，前驱指针是必不可少的。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 82 删除排序链表中的重复元素 II","id":"leetcode-82-删除排序链表中的重复元素-ii"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"前驱指针法","id":"前驱指针法"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"执行过程示例","id":"执行过程示例"},{"level":3,"text":"与 LC #83 的对比","id":"与-lc-83-的对比"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 61 旋转链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-string-linked-list/lc0061-rotate-list"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 133 克隆图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0133-clone-graph"}}